<title>UK: Freddie Mac sets $300 million callable bond. [CORRECTED 15:37 GMT]</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets $300 million callable bond. [CORRECTED 15:37 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by sole lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORP (FREDDIE MAC)</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     7.00	MATURITY  * 16.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    16.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+41 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL FROM 16.SEP.97 (Corrects from 16.SEP.98)</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA  LISTING LUX   SALE LIMS US/UK/JP/FR/GE/HK/SI/TW</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.025     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
